msgctxt "#39052"
msgid "[COLOR white]The emblem in the TV interface header, the add-on icon and the background behind the CoreTube menu entry. Both keep CoreELEC's red open ring with YouTube's play badge inside. A: YouTube's own red badge with a white play triangle, as on its TV app. B: a white badge with a red play triangle, which stands out more against the red ring, especially when small.[/COLOR]"
msgstr ""

